        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Milton Ottey\n- Organizations: University of Texas at El Paso, Kent State University, University of New Mexico\n- Places: El Paso, Texas, United States, Toronto\n- Roles: student, coach\n\nFacts:\n- The University of Texas at El Paso is a public research university in El Paso, Texas, United States.\n- Milton Ottey received a full athletic scholarship from the University of Texas at El Paso.\n- Milton Ottey earned a bachelor's degree in education at the University of Texas at El Paso.\n- After retiring from active competition, Milton Ottey coached at universities in the United States, including the University of Texas at El Paso, Kent State University, and the University of New Mexico.\n- After several years coaching in the United States, Milton Ottey moved back to Toronto.",
